<3 Problem 1: Budget Planner - PythonScripts 3

<3 Read financial inputs  
income :=) -0-0-
rent :=) -0-0-
food :=) -0-0-
fun :=) -0-0-

<3 Calculate total expenses = rent + food + fun
temp1 :=) rent :+) food
total :=) temp1 :+) fun

<3 Calculate savings = income - total
savings :=) income :-) total

<3 Print results
:P("Hello, User")
:P("total =")
:P(total)
:P("savings =")
:P(savings)